Description: PipeWire DSP profiles for Apple Silicon Macs (Aurora)
 Aurora Silicon's PipeWire and WirePlumber DSP profiles for the speakers and
 microphones of Apple Silicon Macs, including the MacBook Neo (J700). They
 replace Debian's asahi-audio.
 .
 The package pulls in the speaker protection: speakersafetyd and speakerguardd
 0.1 keep the speakers of the Macs they support. They are deprecated;
 speakerguardd v2 is opt in, and aurora-speaker-upgrade moves a Mac whose own
 tuning passes the silent self-check to it. Without a running protection
 daemon the kernel keeps the speakers at their safe level.
